                  <nc xml:id="m-be888b13-d295-47e2-a221-c9c65af7709f" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-ab5555bb-95ff-44e6-bbed-c0ed8e7a50aa" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-5402d817-f19a-4dde-b848-9fef2a0c113a" facs="#m-ed1bc18a-62bc-4c27-9cbc-532adb3a3aea" form="maior" /><custos xml:id="m-2620b10a-9c70-4025-9b4d-77c8b699b265" facs="#m-3835ac4b-e53f-4784-9331-6d3f8eac532a" pname="g" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-e48951a9-94e0-4804-8723-3aa34094b888"><lg xml:id="m-2065f0e1-df86-4f54-82d6-8f27da9e96ee"><l xml:id="m-0d397fda-8faf-41ea-a78f-9013aeb03299" facs="#m-cc2c17d6-105c-47ce-b48a-001e65f28c6b" label="ambiguous">June 18. 19.</l><l xml:id="m-a2f72932-2576-41a8-bc8b-e22264b30742" facs="#m-7dc41dcd-1f6d-4bfb-886c-bf1b983f5975" label="ambiguous">1491</l><l xml:id="m-b7d37d84-53e4-49ed-a96a-3a5756e1f4f1" facs="#m-09881589-961c-450d-bbe8-ea43a04186cc" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-2f2b8b73-32f4-490f-9610-5b292d57c933" facs="#m-b66af456-4722-4356-9767-ccfed3085d40" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Gregórium voluisti : ! concéde propítius; ut,</l><l xml:id="m-6f84dd4b-985d-4f8b-8e21-c6a71858cda1" facs="#m-6ca01e31-56ff-4b14-b76e-29b76a5a0525" label="lyrics-like">I confessórem tuum atque Pon-cujus mérita celebrámus, caritátis</l><l xml:id="m-c69c79e0-cedc-496a-8af1-8435a45c9ed8" facs="#m-80c5b14c-003f-42f8-87ad-c5b72a42791f" label="lyrics-like">tíficem pastoráli sollicitudine, et imitémur exémpla. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b19ee025-89aa-417a-a257-ed8abdba47c9" facs="#m-81761592-61c0-4205-bb50-c23c4d0a0fc5" label="lyrics-like">páuperum miseratióne claréscere</l><l xml:id="m-7a2e273a-abe7-4aa3-8b86-29298487461f" facs="#m-4119fae6-74a5-4f66-b20d-93a8802ce683" label="text-like">St. Ephraem the Syrian,</l><l xml:id="m-cb7c16fb-760c-41ea-b995-5897fc6e22e1" facs="#m-141563bf-9850-42cc-a654-11bea2a0895c" label="ambiguous">18.</l><l xml:id="m-c9c7d619-7604-40c9-84a4-578e6f631995" facs="#m-c1bf3441-6829-4bec-9354-699eeed5b749" label="text-like">Deacon, Confessor, and Doctor of the Church. </l><l xml:id="m-82182745-6f51-4961-a818-efb128bed55e" facs="#m-7aeef7b4-6dfd-4640-b4a6-85ca9bc3b81c" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio Ecclésiae. p. 1190, except the Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-50bb551a-e9d0-40e0-b0a1-48bc58eeaa33" facs="#m-6f1fefcf-94d4-479d-ae2e-84a0aaaaece8" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-cb2427ed-09ef-48f3-9411-8833195f2e44" facs="#m-7b0b3b17-7ecd-4e7f-8dbf-b1744ce54b38" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui Ecclésiam tuam beáti te súpplices exorámus; ut, ipso in¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6464c5b-7869-44c4-839e-afa8fb2e1911" facs="#m-9722992a-dfd3-4c61-91e4-1e849e234e10" label="lyrics-like">1 Ephraem Confessóris tui et Do-tercedente,  eam advérsús erróris</l><l xml:id="m-ac544cbc-a4f8-47d9-a5af-06b0f16926b5" facs="#m-65955aee-fc6d-4f36-b70a-5db7bcd7f27d" label="lyrics-like">ctóris mira eruditióne et praecláris et pravitátis insidias perénni tua</l><l xml:id="m-e3863926-54a6-4b48-a24e-ab68d5e86591" facs="#m-d1d3772c-f8de-4f3f-81e2-cd3e620a404e" label="lyrics-like">vitae méritis illustráre voluisti:virtute deféndas. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-aaf67678-4c29-411a-ae52-a2102dd814df" facs="#m-050d977a-29ba-4773-9c79-0cd7e35d39b5" label="lyrics-like">At Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor... beâte Ephraem.</l><l xml:id="m-07ab780a-423e-447a-a9c4-795e3ed654cb" facs="#m-856a57d3-0fb5-481a-a136-253928fe67bf" label="text-like">Commemoration of SS. Mark and Marcellian, Martyrs.</l><l xml:id="m-99633e57-be4d-465f-b4ec-3dfd0ae04ca8" facs="#m-8c0fb3c7-e3ed-460c-b15b-7c94125bed85" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-4a75e0fb-2f93-45a9-9d11-d373115d5a44" facs="#m-63474890-941e-4ad6-89a1-ecb48cf6457a" label="lyrics-like">Raesta, quaésumus, omnípotens natalítia cólimus; a cunctis malis</l><l xml:id="m-d58781a0-577d-4c69-825f-46f65994f26a" facs="#m-71dc9c81-2ebe-4f54-938c-022d140c6a23" label="lyrics-like">imminéntibus eórum intercessióni¬</l><l xml:id="m-d54f37f7-bb75-4f72-b23b-292f1960e573" facs="#m-852b2abc-b3b4-42e6-83b4-38c2f72af02f" label="lyrics-like">LDeus: * ut qui sanctórum Már¬</l><l xml:id="m-6adb214e-22e4-4e5c-9808-243b883cc5c4" facs="#m-80a6bbec-689a-46ce-8b54-34fbe1a0d361" label="lyrics-like">tyrum tuórum Marci et Marcelliáni bus liberémur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-ce60c0b8-aee2-43a2-be8a-c94048476b2d" facs="#m-3614c314-32e1-466c-8167-a7fc884192fc" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-290fe551-240b-45e5-bf26-3f38d6c33eb8" facs="#m-81c5b37d-77b3-4653-9654-664a1e3c88c2" label="lyrics-like">Unera tibi, Dómine, dicáta et Marcelliáno, per éadem nos pla¬</l><l xml:id="m-abeaf80f-c229-4ee5-a443-0088428bb82c" facs="#m-9261193d-8b82-4c94-bb44-dcfd07bebca1" label="lyrics-like">1 sanctífica: et, intercedénti-] cátus inténde. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3274e10a-830b-4722-85ae-e58ec3f9d109" facs="#m-8cccd02c-22bb-4f04-ab41-9c1b3af6258a" label="ambiguous">bus sanctis Martyribus tuis Marco</l><l xml:id="m-a0ed4f98-9a09-45aa-8ff5-92c40ec05092" facs="#m-e4c8a49e-864a-497c-a229-965fd794f81a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-35c64794-d34d-4b1a-b755-6bfe408b7def" facs="#m-2e6cbf0b-caa7-47da-870b-9ae46be1f5a8" label="lyrics-like">CAlutáris tui, Dómine, múnere bus sanctis Martyribus tuis Marco</l><l xml:id="m-58b9cba4-4ac6-4560-8192-b7039cea60ba" facs="#m-91a51800-8dd3-4643-ab94-9c27eb70c877" label="lyrics-like">et Marcelliano, renovémur efféctu.</l><l xml:id="m-a4fe1d15-c672-4bd7-b234-059e89059d5e" facs="#m-6e735f47-fa9f-44b7-837e-53811c2c363c" label="lyrics-like">O satiáti, supplices exorámus : ut</l><l xml:id="m-5b571d19-cf58-4625-8ed8-c610944a38a6" facs="#m-516082b4-fecb-4328-b5c1-d329acdc5c54" label="lyrics-like">cujus laetámur gustu, intercedénti- Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2bd2661a-2712-4b1c-a3ab-79633a9b5951" facs="#m-62c7f591-6208-4fe2-93b9-c9e984d0d8ca" label="ambiguous">St. Juliana Falconieri, Virgin.</l><l xml:id="m-03c71374-3fbe-4f71-983a-55644eb737b3" facs="#m-d28c7715-2841-4e57-8818-9ce5c269e938" label="ambiguous">Domble.</l><l xml:id="m-8bbf8bb4-7870-42cc-a4c1-c30972fbb8a2" facs="#m-05fa0d8e-5f87-43c6-8287-77f1cf83554b" label="ambiguous">19.</l><l xml:id="m-3a8f892b-5d76-4078-804e-a02f50d45554" facs="#m-dc576ffe-673f-4c54-a187-ab6e85ec0ae0" label="text-like">At Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-232f7a3c-0d0e-4ede-a74b-a4e0112e66e8" facs="#m-66a22efc-99ab-4c4e-bbad-1ee955637be4" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-41488aba-1ab8-4347-a3eb-fdaa89c0f1ab" facs="#m-377132fc-772e-46f7-9389-272a2a773312" label="ambiguous">s.</l><l xml:id="m-94d2e580-1b1c-4fc4-9531-027f1d2fa91c" facs="#m-5c4ecae8-b81a-43f4-a04e-2283392d3a8d" label="lyrics-like">Aeléstis Agni núpti-as, O Ju-li-ána, dum pé-tis,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>